      "text": "*sigh*... What have I done?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 50.6,
      "end_time": 52.5,
      "text": "Any wish will be granted'..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 52.7,
      "end_time": 55.5,
      "text": "It was too good to be true."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 55.7,
      "end_time": 58.4,
      "text": "I thought I was aware of that"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 58.6,
