      "text": "Well, well"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 59.8,
      "end_time": 62.5,
      "text": "So everyone except him got away?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 62.9,
      "end_time": 65.1,
      "text": "That pig is amazing."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 65.6,
      "end_time": 66.5,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 66.7,
      "end_time": 70.0,
      "text": "Azold-san, don't you have to run away?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 70.6,
      "end_time": 74.2,
      "text": "If I run, You will just shoot me in the back."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
